// Go workspace tying the app, its installer operator, and the forge client and
// tenancy rules they share, so editor tooling spans all four. Each is its own
// module on purpose:
// controller-runtime's k8s.io/* tree must not constrain the app's KubeVirt/Argo
// client versions, and the operator must not build against the app module.
// The relative replaces in go.mod resolve pkg/forge and pkg/tenancy without the
// workspace, which is how the images build (GOWORK=off) and why ./... at the
// root skips the operator and the pkg modules.
go 1.27.4

use (
	.
	./operator
	./pkg/forge
	./pkg/tenancy
)
